Added conditions on occurrence of locadvrels. Needed because all advvar rules 
(loc, temp, sent) are collapsed into one large iterative class.
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author: 
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] Introduction of variables for referential time adverbials that 
are retrospective. These time adverbials are supposed to be of category 
ADVP, PREPP or SENTENCE. They will be substituted in the substitution rules.
A perfective adverbial can only be inserted into an imperfective clause.
\item[\ \ strategy:] deviation from accepted proposal of doc 53: the variables 
for retrospective time adverbials are no longer introduced by the aspect 
rules, but by rules in a separate rule class preceding these 
rules in the VERBPPROPformation subgrammar.
