\item[* relevant literature/documents:] 53
\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item problems:\\
\item modifications: CONJSENT has been substituted by SENTENCE\\
Because of this change, the generalisation over the time attributes is no 
longer possible. the rule had to be split up into 3 subrules.\\
The place of this rule has been moved to the VERBPPROPformation subgrammar.\\
The adverbial variables are inserted in a
fixed order (generatively): reference, 
retro, duration.
\end{enumerate}
\end{description}

