\item[* copied from:] Rtempadvsubstitution1 Spanish
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: 25/08/88\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo
\item date: 09/09/88\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo
\item date: 12/12/88\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo
